            "review_title": "Review at Bun Rieu Cua - Oc Ha Noi Xua",
            "review_text": "Tuấn Vũ Đ\n17 contributions\n0\nThe north of Saigon is pretty.\nMar 2026 • Family\nLately the northern bún in Saigon a lot, old about 2 years ago and want to eat only in Hung Weighty, now too busy. This shop I eat better than Mrs. HB, here there is no 25k + own topping, or choose a combination as this menu. \nI eat the whole pot, the cows here are very soft. The water is not as sour as the other northern restaurants, I see more shallow. The restaurant has a pretty strange spicy peppermint, food is also delicious. The ears are delicious, but the eggs are too red. I’ve been home to eat a few times, pretty good.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten March 28, 2026",
